<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS4" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Context Length Alone Hurts LLM Performance Despite Perfect Retrieval" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.4 </span>Computational Resources and Experiment Statistics of this Work</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS5" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ Context Length Alone Hurts LLM Performance Despite Perfect Retrieval" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.5 </span>Potential Risks</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
