<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Scientific Artifacts Used in this Work</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The datasets used in the work are presented in <a href="#A1.T10" title="In A.3 Scientific Artifacts Used in this Work ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Context Length Alone Hurts LLM Performance Despite Perfect Retrieval" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>. This work only uses the artifacts for research purposes and does not redistribute them. The datasets do not contain sensitive or offensive content.</p>
